{"3503590": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Kitty Claw", "steam_appid": 3503590, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are the claw. The plushie is the hero. Together, you’re saving the world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Kitty Claw</i>, you control a claw machine arm on a chaotic, adventure outside the arcade and into a world in peril. Your mission? Protect a brave plushie who's determined to be a hero—and might just be the only hope left.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swing, grab, throw, and smash your way through physics-driven environments, massive boss battles, and an increasingly wild journey from coin-op claw machine to full-blown world-saving mayhem. Use strategy, timing, and a simple claw to keep your plushie buddy safe and deal damage in creative, over-the-top ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503590/extras/catDoll.png?t=1760443300\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be the Claw:</strong> Control a fully physics-driven claw machine arm with precision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Protect the Plushie:</strong> Defend your soft and squishy hero while helping them traverse a dangerous world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Battles:</strong> Fight towering enemies in high-stakes combat where positioning, timing, and clutch grabs matter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From Arcade to Apocalypse:</strong> Escape the toy machine and explore quirky, colorful environments full of secrets and surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade and Evolve:</strong> Unlock new claw types, power-ups, and ridiculous gadgets that let you smash in style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Deck Ready:</strong> Designed from the ground up to run great on Steam Deck with native controls and smooth performance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503590/extras/stuff_toy_norse_black_1.png?t=1760443300\" /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are the claw. The plushie is the hero. Together, you’re saving the world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Kitty Claw</i>, you control a claw machine arm on a chaotic, adventure outside the arcade and into a world in peril. Your mission? Protect a brave plushie who's determined to be a hero—and might just be the only hope left.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swing, grab, throw, and smash your way through physics-driven environments, massive boss battles, and an increasingly wild journey from coin-op claw machine to full-blown world-saving mayhem. Use strategy, timing, and a simple claw to keep your plushie buddy safe and deal damage in creative, over-the-top ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503590/extras/catDoll.png?t=1760443300\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Be the Claw:</strong> Control a fully physics-driven claw machine arm with precision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Protect the Plushie:</strong> Defend your soft and squishy hero while helping them traverse a dangerous world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Battles:</strong> Fight towering enemies in high-stakes combat where positioning, timing, and clutch grabs matter.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From Arcade to Apocalypse:</strong> Escape the toy machine and explore quirky, colorful environments full of secrets and surprises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade and Evolve:</strong> Unlock new claw types, power-ups, and ridiculous gadgets that let you smash in style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Deck Ready:</strong> Designed from the ground up to run great on Steam Deck with native controls and smooth performance.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503590/extras/stuff_toy_norse_black_1.png?t=1760443300\" /></span></p>", "short_description": "Play as a heroic claw machine arm in this quirky puzzle-adventure! Team up with a brave plushie, escape the arcade, and take on towering bosses. Grab, fling, and smash your way through a colorful world in a cozy, chaotic quest to save the world—one claw at a time.", "supported_languages": "English, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503590/60f80bee122d8a7885e82afebd310f536c8678b9/header.jpg?t=1760443300", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503590/f1cd8df41999492022d2b3bc47f85cce7e1e3dab/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760443300", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3503590/f1cd8df41999492022d2b3bc47f85cce7e1e3dab/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760443300", "website": "https://nuclearkittygames.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 3 3300X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1060 (6GB) / AMD Radeon RX 580 (8GB)<br></li><li><strong>Direct